diff --git a/saas/README.md b/saas/README.md
index 28b0891..4f96b39 100644
--- a/saas/README.md
+++ b/saas/README.md
@@ -40,6 +40,19 @@ bin/dev # You need to start the dev server in the same terminal session
 
 This will ask for your 1password authorization to read and set the environment variables that Stripe needs.
 
+### Billing
+
+Plans live in `app/models/plan.rb`: Free (1,000 cards, 1 GB), Unlimited ($20/month, 5 GB) and Unlimited+ ($25/month, 500 GB). Stripe hosts checkout and the customer portal; the app needs these environment variables:
+
+* `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`
+* `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` — signing secret for the `/stripe/webhooks` endpoint
+* `STRIPE_MONTHLY_V1_PRICE_ID` — price for Unlimited
+* `STRIPE_MONTHLY_EXTRA_STORAGE_V1_PRICE_ID` — price for Unlimited+
+
+The webhook endpoint must receive `checkout.session.completed` and the `customer.subscription.*` events (`created`, `updated`, `deleted`, `paused`, `resumed`).
+
+Support tools live at `/admin/accounts`: comp/uncomp an account, and override (or reset) the card count and bytes used that limits are checked against.
+
 ### Stripe environments
 
 * [Development](https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1SdTFtRus34tgjsJ/test/dashboard)
diff --git a/saas/app/controllers/account/billing_portals_controller.rb b/saas/app/controllers/account/billing_portals_controller.rb
